IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDECODE-V8.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SYNC-GROUPS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOKENS-PER-GROUP    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SYNC-EFF-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDECODE-V8.
    IF BATCH-SIZE == 0 OR SYNC-GROUPS == 0 OR TOKENS-PER-GROUP == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 97 TO SYNC-EFF-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BATCH-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 SYNC-EFF-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
